{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123566","id":4552405921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD1gzoQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123566","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123566.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123566.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123566","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123566/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123566/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123566/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6da35be63e62cc54e373aae3ab1eca08f82c7f77","number":123566,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `get_executable_path` on OpenBSD using `getexecpath(3)`","user":{"login":"rfht","id":11335318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzM1MzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11335318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht","html_url":"https://github.com/rfht","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rfht/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes get_executable_path on OpenBSD which had been using OS-local workarounds, but now has getexecpath(3). Closes related PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/61540\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI've kept it simple and close to the __Linux__ section. I'm not sure about the importance of the `append_utf8` method, but applied it here functionally the same as for Linux.\r\n\r\nThe chance of getexecpath(3) failing per the man page are very low; mainly if the directory where the binary was started isn't linked to the file system anymore. With the Godot installation on OpenBSD in /usr/local/bin, this should be extremely unlikely and there would be much bigger issues, so `ERR_FAIL` seemed like the best way to handle this unlikely event.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gi